rnote over User: User generates PSBT using a otherwise independent watch-only wallet module.

' Step 1
User o-> Niso:  <b>WithdrawalNisoInput1 \n psbt
hnote over Niso #LavenderBlush:  Niso receives psbt from User. Niso checks that most_work_bitcoin_block_height \n has passed milestone_block_0 from boomerang_descriptor, \n derives tx_id from psbt and stores it. Niso also checks to see if psbt inputs are satisfiable. It sends the \n psbt alongside the latest \n block_height to Boomlet.
hnote over Niso #Lavender:  most_work_bitcoin_block_height := rpc_client.get_block_height()
hnote over Niso #Pink:  Assert most_work_bitcoin_block_height >= \n boomerang_params.boomerang_descriptor.milestone_block_0 .
hnote over Niso #Lavender:  tx_id := psbt.derive_tx_id(). \n niso_0_event_block_height := most_work_bitcoin_block_height
hnote over Niso #Pink: Assert hydrate_psbt(psbt) != Null

' Step 2
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>WithdrawalNisoBoomletMessage1 \n psbt \n niso_0_event_block_height
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet receives {psbt, niso_0_event_block_height} from Niso and checks to \n see if the niso_0_event_block_height has passed \n milestone_block_0. Boomlet then derives tx_id from psbt, creates st_preview_nonce, uses st_preview_nonce for \n ST freshness, encrypts it for st_0_identity_pubkey and sends the envelope to Niso.
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert niso_0_event_block_height >= \n boomerang_params.boomerang_descriptor.milestone_block_0 .
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  tx_id := psbt.derive_tx_id() \n st_preview_nonce := random_bytes(32)
group ST_check(tx_id)
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  tx_id_with_nonce := MessageWithNonce{ \n content: {tx_id}, \n nonce: st_preview_nonce \n } \n tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st := encrypt_for_st_0(context: canonical_encode("withdrawal_tx_review"), \n content: tx_id_with_nonce)

' Step 3
Boomlet o-> Niso:  <b>WithdrawalBoomletNisoMessage1 \n tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
hnote over Niso #LavenderBlush:  Niso receives tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st from Boomlet and \n forwards it to ST.

' Step 4
Niso o-> ST:  <b>WithdrawalNisoStMessage1 \n tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st
hnote over ST #LavenderBlush:  ST receives tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st from Niso, decrypts \n it, separates the nonce and sends the tx_id to User.
hnote over ST #Lavender:  tx_id_with_nonce := decrypt_from_boomlet_0(context: canonical_encode("withdrawal_tx_review"), \n envelope: tx_id_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st) \n tx_id := tx_id_with_nonce.content.tx_id \n st_preview_nonce := tx_id_with_nonce.nonce

' Step 5
ST o-> User:  <b>WithdrawalStOutput1 \n tx_id
hnote over User #LavenderBlush:  User receives tx_id from ST and checks to see if it matches that of the psbt \n he generated. User then informs ST of his acknowledgement of tx_id.
hnote over User #Pink: Assert tx_id == psbt.derive_tx_id()

' Step 6
User o-> ST:  <b>WithdrawalStInput1 \n magic: \n "withdrawal_initiator_peer_approved_that_txid_received_is_the_same_as_the_one_derived_from_withdrawal_psbt"
hnote over ST #LavenderBlush:  ST receives {magic: \n "withdrawal_initiator_peer_approved_that_txid_received_is_the_same_as_the_one_derived_from_withdrawal_psbt"} \n from User. \n ST then signs the tx_id_with_nonce it received with st_privkey and encrypts it with boomlet_0_identity_pubkey. \n It then sends this encrypted \n message to Niso.
hnote over ST #Lavender:  tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st := sign_message(st_0_identity_privkey, \n "Boomerang/withdrawal/tx_review_approval", tx_id_with_nonce) \n tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0 := encrypt_for_boomlet_0(context: canonical_encode("withdrawal_tx_review_approval"), \n content: tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st)

' Step 7
ST o-> Niso:  <b>WithdrawalStNisoMessage1 \n tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
hnote over Niso #LavenderBlush:  Niso receives tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0 \n from ST and forwards it to Boomlet.

' Step 8
Niso o-> Boomlet:  <b>WithdrawalNisoBoomletMessage2 \n tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet receives \n tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0 from Niso, decrypts it, verifies \n st_0_identity_pubkey's signature \n and checks if the content is the same as the one sent i.e. User has acknowledged the tx_id and the message is \n fresh. Boomlet then creates initiator_approval_nonce and computes withdrawal_id. It then generates \n peer_0_tx_approval containing withdrawal_id, initiator_approval_nonce, and event_block_height, signs it with \n boomlet_0_identity_privkey and encrypts it for wt. It \n then encrypts psbt for every other boomlet_i using withdrawal_id-bound envelopes. Boomlet sends withdrawal_id, \n the resulting psbt_encrypted_collection, \n and peer_0_tx_approval_signed_by_boomlet_0_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_wt to Niso.
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st := decrypt_from_st_0(context: canonical_encode("withdrawal_tx_review_approval"), \n envelope: tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st_encrypted_by_st_for_boomlet_0)
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(st_0_identity_pubkey, \n "Boomerang/withdrawal/tx_review_approval", tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st) == True
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  <b>Freshness check \n Assert tx_id_with_nonce_signed_by_st.content == tx_id_with_nonce
end group
end group
