hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet receives {ordered_peer_tx_approvals, wt_tx_approval_signed_by_wt, \n niso_0_event_block_height} \n from Niso. Boomlet verifies each boomlet_i_identity_pubkey's signature on each \n peer_i_tx_approval_signed_by_boomlet_i, verifies wt_pubkey's \n signature on wt_tx_approval_signed_by_wt and updates niso_0_event_block_height with the new value. It checks \n withdrawal_id to match what was sent, the event_block_heights to be in the appropriate range, and \n ordered_peer_tx_approvals to contain exactly one approval per setup peer in peer_ids_collection order. \n It computes approved_withdrawal_id from withdrawal_id and ordered_peer_tx_approvals. It then generates \n duress_check_space as one randomly sorted list of integers from 1 to 193, including all elements of 1..193, \n adds a nonce to it and encrypts it. Then Boomlet sends \n duress_check_space_with_nonce_encrypted_by_boomlet_0_for_st to Niso.
