hnote over Niso #LavenderBlush:  Niso receives {pong_0_signed_by_wt_encrypted_by_wt_for_boomlet_0, \n duress_placeholder_signed_by_sar_encrypted_by_sar_for_boomlet_0} from WT and \n forwards them to Boomlet alongside the latest most_work_bitcoin_block_height as niso_0_event_block_height.
